# Properties that no file under hw/femu/tests/ or hw/femu/scripts/ names.
# hw/femu/scripts/check-property-tests.py reads this list. Each line is
#   NAME  REASON
# A new property needs a test, or a line here. Remove a line when a test
# names the property; the check fails for a line whose property is tested.

persistent-memdev   inherited from QEMU cxl-type3; femu-cxl-ssd does not document a use
volatile-dc-memdev  inherited from QEMU cxl-type3; femu-cxl-ssd does not document a use
x-speed             inherited from QEMU cxl-type3 (link speed); QEMU owns it
x-width             inherited from QEMU cxl-type3 (link width); QEMU owns it
cylon-emul-exit     needs a host kernel with the Cylon patch; no qtest can reach it
max_sqes            no test yet: Identify SQES field only
max_cqes            no test yet: Identify CQES field only
elpe                no test yet: Identify ELPE field only
intc_thresh         no test yet
intc_time           no test yet
err_read_unc_ppm    no test yet
mapping_cache_mb    no test yet
cache_evict         no test yet
debug_ftl           no test yet: turns on debug output only
tier_pslc_pe_cycles no test yet
fw_write_ns         no test yet
zns_cross_zone_read no test yet
lmax_sec_per_rq     no test yet: OCSSD 1.2 Identify field
mpsmin              no test yet: CAP.MPSMIN field only
